flowchart TD
  Start["Scheduler or manual Run Now"] --> Lock{"Pipeline already running?"}
  Lock -->|"yes"| Skip["Skip overlapping run"]
  Lock -->|"no"| System{"system_running setting true?"}
  System -->|"no"| Paused["Return without ingestion"]
  System -->|"yes"| Ingest["Ingest timeline via Playwright"]
  Ingest --> Upsert["Validate tweet ID and upsert new posts"]
  Upsert --> Filter["Detect language and topic filter"]
  Filter --> Score["Score recency, topic relevance, reply opportunity, engagement, Marathi bonus"]
  Score --> Threshold{"Any scored post >= min_score?"}
  Threshold -->|"yes"| Rank["Rank candidates"]
  Threshold -->|"no"| Fallback["Select best new fallback candidate"]
  Rank --> Generate["Generate reply with Groq"]
  Fallback --> Generate
  Generate --> Pending["Store generated/final reply as PENDING_APPROVAL"]
  Pending --> Notify["Send ntfy approval notification"]
  Notify --> Complete["Log PIPELINE_COMPLETE"]
